 ormulas sheet\, then close it and reconstruct the Ohm/Watt relationships f
 rom memory.\n3. Complete 12–15 beginner CETa-style questions/problems co
 vering Week 1 only.\n4. Predict current and voltage drops for a current-li
 mited LED/resistor circuit before Saturday's build.\n5. Write a short safe
 -DMM checklist: voltage measurement\, resistance measurement\, and what no
 t to do.\n\nMASTERY GATE: In plain language\, explain charge\, voltage\, c
 urrent\, resistance\, power\, polarity\, open vs short\, and basic ESD/sho
 ck precautions\; use SI prefixes\; solve fresh Ohm/Watt problems\; then bu
 ild and safely measure a current-limited LED circuit on Saturday.\n\nWEEK 
