 sity/resources.html\nCAREER CONNECTION: Foundational circuit measurement a
 nd safe troubleshooting.\nRESOURCE PRIORITY: CETa Core → Career Core →
  Deep Dive. Complete the required work first\; use Deep Dive for repair or
  extra depth.\n\nWEEK 4 FOCUS: AC Waveforms + R/C/L Behavior +Frequency/Pe
 riod/RMS\nETA/CETa SCOPE: 2.8–2.12.2\; 4.2–4.4\; 9.3\;9.7\nCAREER/EMBE
 DDED PURPOSE: RC timing\, decoupling\, inductivebehavior\, waveform readin
 g\; relate frequency-domain concepts toembedded signals.\n\nTHIS WEEK'S RE
 SOURCES:\n- Capacitors and Inductorsplaylist: https://www.youtube.com/play
 list?list=PLB9A78ED3D7EF1AE5\n-ETA Common Formulas: https://www.etai.org/C
