 p.\n\nSIMPLE COMPLETION RULE\nFinish the assigned work\, then check the le
 arning outcomes below. If you cannot explain or demonstrate an outcome\, w
 rite that one concept on a short catch-up list and repair it during the ne
 xt available review block. No spreadsheet logging is required.
