 ent\, and phase.\n• Explain resonance and the role of inductance and cap
 acitance in tuned behavior.\n• Describe basic low-pass\, high-pass\, ban
 d-pass\, and band-stop filter behavior.\n• Calculate basic XL\, XC\, imp
 edance/ratio/resonance relationships at the assigned CETa depth.\n• Pred
 ict how changing frequency changes circuit behavior.\n• Explain transfor
 mer turns ratio\, voltage/current relationships\, isolation\, and basic lo
 ading ideas.\n• Use calculations\, simulation\, or measurements to verif
 y frequency-dependent circuit behavior.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned re
