 eer Core → Deep Dive. Complete the required work first\; use Deep Dive f
 or repair or extra depth.\n\nWEEK 8 FOCUS: Semiconductors: Diodes + BJT/FE
 T/MOSFET +SCR/TRIAC\nETA/CETa SCOPE: 3.5–3.7.3\nCAREER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE:
 Switching\, biasing\, logic-level MOSFETs\, flyback diodes\, Zenerregulati
 on\, semiconductor fault symptoms.\n\nTHIS WEEK'S RESOURCES:\n-Electronics
  for Beginners:https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLzqS33DOPhJkRn6e9_OT
