 be.com/watch?v=kY-ka0PriaE\n- ETA CETa competencies:https://www.etai.org/c
 omps/CETa_comps.pdf\n\nMASTERY GATE: Identifydevices and terminals\, analy
 ze simple bias/current/power\, select atransistor/MOSFET as a switch\, and
