 rrent topic.\n\nAFTER TODAY — REQUIRED LEARNING OUTCOMES (WEEK 08)\nBy t
 he end of this event\, you should be able to explain or demonstrate:\n• 
 Explain PN junction behavior and the operation/use of rectifier diodes\, L
 EDs\, Zener diodes\, and protection diodes.\n• Explain BJT switching at 
 a practical level and distinguish NPN/PNP behavior.\n• Explain FET/MOSFE
 T gate control\, source/drain roles\, logic-level switching\, and common p
 rotection concerns.\n• Recognize SCR/TRIAC purpose and where controlled 
 switching devices are used.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned resources and 
 tasks above are intended to cover every item in this outcome list. If you 
