 chematic/overview\n\nMASTERY GATE:Trace power/signal flow on an unfamiliar
  diagram\, choose next testpoints\, locate a seeded fault\, and write a co
 ncise defect/root-causenote.\n\nSYSTEM RULES: Watching alone never counts.
