 arathon.\n\nTODAY:\nBuild/measure/debug the practical objective.Photograph
  or capture evidence\, document expected vs actual\, andcommit the lab not
 e/code. Completion requires demonstration\, notwatching.\n\nEMBEDDED INTER
 FACE CORE GATE — ADVANCE/REPEAT DECISION: GREEN = mastery is demonstrabl
 e and you advance. YELLOW = advance but carry no more than 1–2 specific 
 weak items forward with a short written repair date. RED = a core/safety/p
 ractical gap is material\; use the next available buffer/repair block befo
 re treating the gate as complete. The calendar date never overrides compet
 ence.\n\nREFERENCE HUB — KEEP THESE LINKS:\n• Official Associate CET S
 tudy Guide\, 6th ed.: use your scanned/Google Drive copy and the PRINTED p
