 C controller/target roles\, SDA/SCL\, addressing\, pull-ups\, start/stop\,
  read/write\, ACK/NACK\, and basic transactions.\n• Explain SPI controll
 er/peripheral roles\, SCLK\, MOSI\, MISO\, chip select\, transaction frami
 ng\, and the idea of clock mode.\n• Choose I2C or SPI appropriately for 
 a simple peripheral and wire it correctly.\n• Use a logic analyzer to ca
 pture and decode UART and the chosen I2C/SPI bus.\n• Integrate a real se
 nsor/peripheral and convert raw data into meaningful units.\n• Interface
