 onstrate:\n• Recognize common cable\, connector\, transmission-media\, a
 udio/video\, and optical/fiber concepts in the CETa scope.\n• Explain ba
 sic impedance\, shielding\, grounding\, connector integrity\, continuity\,
  and signal-loss concerns for cabling.\n• Describe basic audio/video sig
 nal paths and common failure points at a technician level.\n• Explain ba
 sic optical/fiber concepts\, source/path/receiver thinking\, attenuation\,
  and handling cautions.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned resources and task
